10-10","DPU","Information Requests","Department of Public Utilities’ First Set of Information Requests to The Berkshire Gas Company",[["dpu24124firstsetofinformationr.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihghjbge?Cl5lU7bS%2Fh9vZBEEUoOhi8EmiDhMBXK0ednWT8WFP5Ok9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"]],"dpu"],["2024-10-07","Attorney General","Appearance of Counsel","Notice of Substitution of Counsel on behalf of the Office of the Attorney General",[["dpu24124agonoticeofsubstitutio.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihfcaagj?rqN8z9bI6bXQ9i3b3L7Y52FJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"]],null],["2024-10-04","DPU","Hearing Officer Memorandum","Hearing Officer Memorandum RE: New Deadline for Comments",[["dpu24124homemoregardingnewcomm.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihegejbe?sdMToZ0W4hqE4hHyZQFPZ8EmiDhMBXK0ednWT8WFP5Ok9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"]],"memo"],["2024-10-04","The Berkshire Gas Company","Correspondence","As outlined in the Company’s response to Information Request AG-1-1, which was filed in this proceeding on September 30, 2024, at the time of implementation of rates associated with the Department’s approval in D.P.U. 22-20, the Company determined that its then and currently effective Revenue Decoupling Adjustment Clause (“RDAC”) Tariff, M.D.P.U. No. 579, did not require adjustment for effect January 1, 2024. However, upon further review of the Revised Uniform RDAF Filing Requirements for All Gas and Electric Distribution Companies, D.P.U. 21-RDAF-01, the Company has determined it is, in fact, appropriate to submit a revised RDAC tariff to reflect the updated Benchmark Base Revenue per Customer (“BRPC”) for effect November 1, 2024. With this letter, the Company includes a clean and redlined version of its proposed RDAC tariff, M.D.P.U. No. 608, be effective November 1, 2024. The Company’s RDAC Tariff has been modified to reflect the BRPCs based on the customer rates stamp-approved by the Department on December 29, 2023 in D.P.U. 22-20 To that end, the Company has updated Section 1.4.4 of the RDAC tariff to reflect the correct Winter and Summer BRPC. The Company respectfully requests that the Department grant such waivers as it may deem necessary for the acceptance of this filing to be effective November 1, 2024.",[["dpu24124berkshirerdafcoverlett.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihegdbaj?9fZ1LDPjQJE03ngS1Z5iXWFJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["608rdactariffmdpu608redlinecom.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihegdbae?9fZ1LDPjQJE03ngS1Z5iXcEmiDhMBXK0ednWT8WFP5Ok9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["608rdactariffmdpu608cleancompl.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihegdbbj?rvQo6hJGCA8XQX8yQ7xOwGFJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"]],null],["2024-09-26","The Berkshire Gas Company","Information Request Responses","Company’s responses to the First Set of Information Requests issued by the Office of the Attorney General",[["dpu24124bgcresponsestoagset1cl.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihehdffj?RbHh6U2k9HahzVkaCe9iymFJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["ag11.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/ihehdffe?RbHh6U2k9HahzVkaCe9iysEmiDhMBXK0ednWT8WFP5Ok9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["attachmentag11.xlsx","https://fileservice.e